# Observability

## Patterns
- Structured logger (`@nestlancer/logger`), correlation IDs (`@nestlancer/tracing`), Prometheus (`@nestlancer/metrics`)
- `AllExceptionsFilter` returns stable error envelopes; stacks stay server-side

## Rules
- Propagate/create correlation IDs on gateway and workers; include them in logs
- Unknown errors → generic client message; log details with redaction
- Do not log raw tokens, passwords, card data, or full webhook payloads with secrets
- Prefer existing metrics helpers over ad-hoc counters
- Health endpoints stay cheap and unauthenticated only for liveness/readiness intent
- When adding critical paths (pay, auth, outbox), add actionable logs + metrics, not just `console.log`
